  lines:
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave>...
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave a*.5>How long have I been driving...
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave a*.5>When did I last sleep...
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave a*.1>It doesn't matter.
  - <?PlayerTalk><shake a*.5>I can't... go back.
  - '<?PlayerTalk><shake a*.75>I''m afraid... I''m not happy. '
  - <?PlayerTalk><shake a*.25>...was I ever?
  - <?PlayerTalk><shake a*.5>...
  - <?PlayerTalk><shake a*.5>That person over there... is that <color=#7486DFFF>them<color=#BEA63FFF>?
  - '<?PlayerTalk><wave a*.5>It can''t be... '
  - <?PlayerTalk><wave a*.5>A bit closer...
  - <?PlayerTalk><shake a*2>NO-
